        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Recent Changes &amp; Active Architecture Highlights:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Key Vault AzureServices Bypass:&lt;/b&gt; Key Vault network ACLs set to &lt;code&gt;bypass = AzureServices&lt;/code&gt;, enabling App Gateway v2 to load its SSL cert via managed identity.&lt;br/&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;Cross-Origin Gateway Support:&lt;/b&gt; Added &lt;code&gt;https://aiflux-gateway-dev.eastus.cloudapp.azure.com&lt;/code&gt; to CORS allowed origins for both Control Plane API and APIM adapter.&lt;br/&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;Guarded /dev/llm/v1 Adapter:&lt;/b&gt; Active OpenAI-compatible adapter supporting Luna, Sol, and Claude Haiku 5.5 (with internal thinking block stripping &amp; 20k TPM limit).&lt;br/&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;Hybrid Private Data:&lt;/b&gt; Azure SQL, Key Vault, and Storage run with public network access disabled via Private Endpoints in VNet &lt;code&gt;10.240.3.0/24&lt;/code&gt;." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=5;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;fontColor=#92400E;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="880" width="680" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
